WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.188
A failed transaction records what happened.

00:00:03.408 --> 00:00:07.547
You still need the engineering judgment about what to do next.

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:10.519
Rouse keeps that judgment with its evidence.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.228
Start with the error text.

00:00:14.448 --> 00:00:18.437
Search the reviewed case library without reviewer access.

00:00:18.657 --> 00:00:23.137
Here. the search finds a real duplicate-cancellation procedure.

00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:29.416
A text match makes this related reading. Transaction inspection checks whether it applies.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.847
This order had already been cancelled.

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:41.510
The reference procedure compares the exact order and authenticated earlier cancellation effects.

00:00:41.729 --> 00:00:45.740
When they match. reconcile local state and stop retrying.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:52.637
A named reviewer approved this procedure. The original operator's deployment remains unknown.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.743
Now inspect a different real failed transaction.

00:00:58.963 --> 00:01:02.824
Tatum fetches its actual Sui Mainnet execution evidence.

00:01:03.044 --> 00:01:09.423
The digest. failure. command and provenance stay visible while Rouse checks the retained cases.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:17.471
Walrus recalls the reviewed resolution from its completed Mainnet blob.

00:01:17.691 --> 00:01:24.176
The same blob appears for this distinct incident. with matching reasons and reviewer attribution.

00:01:24.396 --> 00:01:29.367
The missing SDK version remains visible for the engineer to assess.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:43.137
Recording new knowledge requires reviewer access. specific evidence and an explicit human causal review.

00:01:43.357 --> 00:01:49.032
An accepted storage job is still pending until a completed receipt is returned.

00:01:49.252 --> 00:01:55.289
This existing case already has that receipt. This demo reuses it without another write.

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:04.023
An unrelated failure does not receive this reviewed resolution.

00:02:04.243 --> 00:02:10.579
Thirteen completed memories include one reviewed case; the other evidence tiers stay separate.

00:02:10.799 --> 00:02:16.602
Rouse does not execute repairs or claim a historical transaction was repaired.

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:23.620
Find earlier judgment. Inspect its evidence. Decide what to reuse.

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:27.083
Rouse. The next failure shouldn't start from zero.
